B.axx={"You created a multi-phone room that's still waiting. Reconnect to keep hosting it.":0,Dismiss:1,"is a phone and web dice game developed with Flutter and Dart. It supports human and robot players, upper and lower section scoring, an upper-section bonus, a Five of a Kind bonus, saved player history, hints, and shared T-G-Apps presentation.":2,"Player 1 is always Human in Pass-and-Play.":3,"If I Disconnect":4,[u.n3]:5,"Abandon hand":6,"Robot plays for me until I reconnect":7,"The multi-phone game runs on the host's phone, so it cannot continue without it. If the host reconnects soon, this game will pick back up on its own.":8,"5 of a Kind Bonus \u2022 automatic":9,"Total of all 1s.":10,"Total of all 2s.":11,"Total of all 3s.":12,"Total of all 4s.":13,"Total of all 5s.":14,"Total of all 6s.":15,[u.gV]:16,[u.gA]:17,[u.X]:18,[u.pp]:19,"Four consecutive dice. Scores 30.":20,"Five consecutive dice. Scores 40.":21,"All five dice match. Scores 50.":22,"Score the total of all dice.":23,"categories complete":24,"Roll to begin your turn.":25,[u.jv]:26,"No bonus points yet":27,"63 points earns the 35-point upper bonus":28,[u.gT]:29,"Leave this multi-phone game?":30,"This multi-phone room is no longer available.":31,"Firebase sign-in could not be completed.":32,"The multi-phone game is complete.":33,"Waiting for the host to start the game.":34,"Volume:":35,"Every remote player is connected and ready.":36,[u.l5]:37,"Human on host phone":38,[u.fd]:39,"Leave this multi-phone room?":40,"The lobby could not be loaded.":41,"Waiting for players.":42,"Waiting for remote players to join.":43,"The game has started.":44,"Robot Players":45,"use a combination of statistical chances of achieving each open scoring category, subject to a strategic system that considers fallback options if an objective is not achieved and what to sacrifice for least final score damage in this eventuality.":46,"The system offers a \u201cHint\u201d button for human players; it reports what the Robot player would do given the Player\u2019s game card thus far and the dice and turn so far. Due to the complexity of the statistical process, hints may seem counter-intuitive or mistaken; like breaking a made hand to try for something else. Please do not report odd Hints as bugs.":47,"Send questions, concerns, or complaints to":48,", used as the application framework and programming language.":49,", used for local player history.":50,", used for shared T-G-Apps music support and dice sound effects.":51,", including privacy policy, exit flow, and game hints components.":52,"\xa9 2026 T-G-Apps. All rights reserved.":53,"T-G-Apps YZ How to Play":54,"T-G-Apps YZ \u2014 How to Play":55,"Tap the dice you want to hold. Dice toggle between green (HOLD, will not reroll) and red (REROLL).":56,"Score the total of the matching dice: Ones, Twos, Threes, Fours, Fives, and Sixes.":57,"Bonus:":58,"If your total in the upper section is 63 or higher, you receive an additional 35 points. T-G-Apps YZ shows your upper total so far, and if you have not yet reached 63 points, the number of additional points you need to get the bonus.":59,"\u2014 at least 4 sequential numbers ([1,2,3,4], [2,3,4,5], [3,4,5,6]). A large straight can also be scored as a small straight. Fixed score.":60,"\u2014 5 sequential numbers ([1,2,3,4,5] or [2,3,4,5,6]). Fixed score.":61,"\u2014 3 of one number and 2 of another. Five of a kind can also be scored as a full house. Fixed score.":62,"\u2014 two sets of two numbers (example: 2-2 and 5-5). Four of a kind, full house, and five of a kind can all be scored as two pair. Score equals the total of all dice.":63,"\u2014 at least 3 matching dice. Four of a kind and five of a kind can be scored as 3 of a kind. Score equals the total of all dice.":64,"\u2014 at least 4 matching dice. Five of a kind can be scored as 4 of a kind. Score equals the total of all dice.":65,"\u2014 all five dice match. High-value category.":66,"After scoring your first 5 of a Kind, each additional 5 of a Kind adds 100 bonus points in the 5 of a Kind Bonus scorecard entry, automatically.":67,"If you scored zero in 5 of a Kind, any subsequent 5-of-a-kind roll does not award any 5 of a Kind bonus points.":68,"You must still choose a category to score. Scoring an additional 5 of a Kind in the upper section scores the selected category normally; for example, [2,2,2,2,2] scores 10 in Twos or zero in Sixes. If you already have a successful 5 of a Kind score, the extra 100-point bonus is still added automatically.":69,"Oops (Last Category)":70,"Player 1 must always be a Human player":71,", regardless of the name entered for Player 1.":72,"Players 2 through 6 may be Human, Robot or Remote players.":73,"Human players sharing a phone pass the device to the player whose turn is shown.":74,"T-G-Apps YZ Release Log":75,"Current release: 1.1.0":76,"(build 2)":77,"Release 1.1.0":78,"Major feature release":79,"July 28, 2026":80,"Switched background music to the shared T-G-Apps_Music package and fixed a bug where the dice-roll sound effect could permanently pause the background music.":81,"Restyled Setup and Game screens with a gold-and-felt-green theme to match T-G-Apps 21, including gold buttons, app bars, and a redesigned Hint button.":82,"Replaced white score, status, and history panels with gold-bordered gradient boxes.":83,"Release 1.0.0":84,"T-G-Apps YZ History":85,"Saved results for named human players. Up to 500 entries are retained. Entries are listed newest first.":86,"Only completed human players with custom names are saved. Default names such as Player 1 are not stored.":87,"Upper:":88,"Lower:":89,"Final:":90,[u.r]:91,[u.M]:92,[u.l8]:93,[u.di]:94,[u.kR]:95,[u.nQ]:96,[u.bH]:97,[u.G]:98,[u.Z]:99,and:100,"T-G-Apps shared packages":101,"The current player":102,"No clear target yet":103,"Matching dice":104,"T-G-Apps Game Catalog":105,"Visual HTML version: 2026-08-30A":106,[u.n]:107,"Audience Policy":108,[u.C]:109,"Current Apps":110,"Dice scorecard strategy":111,[u.A]:112,"Current app":113,"Children &amp; Adults":114,"No wagering":115,[u.po]:116,"Ages 13+":117,"Simulated betting":118,"Texas Hold&#39;em poker":119,[u.ky]:120,"Seven-card stud poker":121,[u.F]:122,"Seven-card draw poker":123,[u.oU]:124,"In Production":125,"Five-card draw poker":126,[u.cQ]:127,"In production":128,"Domino tile strategy":129,[u.d]:130,"Mahjong tile strategy":131,[u.hc]:132,[u.p]:133,[u.R]:134,[u.P]:135,[u.N]:136,"Farkle dice":137,[u.cj]:138,Back:139,"T-G-Apps LLC Privacy Policy":140,"Visual HTML version: 2026-08-22B":141,[u.k6]:142,"Effective Date: June 2, 2026":143,[u.id]:144,"Covered Products":145,"Related websites and online services":146,"1. Information We Collect":147,[u.jY]:148,"Device type":149,"Operating system version":150,"Mobile advertising identifiers":151,"IP address":152,"Approximate geographic region":153,"App usage information":154,"Crash reports and diagnostics":155,"Ad interaction information":156,[u.fo]:157,"2. Advertising":158,[u.b]:159,[u.o]:160,[u.o2]:161,"Google Privacy Policy":162,[u.h1]:163,"3. Analytics and Diagnostics":164,[u.mF]:165,[u.lf]:166,"4. Cookies and Similar Technologies":167,[u.p9]:168,[u.kS]:169,"5. Children&#39;s Privacy":170,[u.iG]:171,[u.f2]:172,"6. Data Sharing":173,[u.iP]:174,[u.mQ]:175,"7. Data Security":176,[u.gP]:177,"8. Third-Party Links and Services":178,[u.ol]:179,"9. Your Rights and Choices":180,[u.jF]:181,[u.bg]:182,"10. Changes to This Privacy Policy":183,[u.eN]:184,"11. Contact Information":185,"Contact Email:":186,[u.q]:187}
B.alm=s(["Creaste una sala multitel\xe9fono que sigue esperando. Vuelve a conectarte para seguir siendo el anfitri\xf3n.","Vous avez cr\xe9\xe9 une salle multi-t\xe9l\xe9phone qui attend toujours. Reconnectez-vous pour continuer \xe0 l\u2019h\xe9berger.","Du hast einen Mehrger\xe4te-Raum erstellt, der noch wartet. Verbinde dich erneut, um ihn weiter zu hosten.","Voc\xea criou uma sala para v\xe1rios celulares que ainda est\xe1 esperando. Reconecte-se para continuar como anfitri\xe3o.","\u3042\u306a\u305f\u304c\u4f5c\u6210\u3057\u305f\u8907\u6570\u7aef\u672b\u306e\u30eb\u30fc\u30e0\u304c\u307e\u3060\u5f85\u6a5f\u4e2d\u3067\u3059\u3002\u518d\u63a5\u7d9a\u3057\u3066\u30db\u30b9\u30c8\u3092\u7d9a\u3051\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002","\u0906\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u090f\u0915 \u092e\u0932\u094d\u091f\u0940-\u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u0930\u0942\u092e \u092c\u0928\u093e\u092f\u093e \u0925\u093e \u091c\u094b \u0905\u092d\u0940 \u092d\u0940 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u0940\u0915\u094d\u0937\u093e \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0939\u094b\u0938\u094d\u091f\u093f\u0902\u0917 \u091c\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u0930\u0916\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0928\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902\u0964","Anda membuat ruang multi-ponsel yang masih menunggu. Sambungkan kembali untuk terus menjadi host.","B\u1ea1n \u0111\xe3 t\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t ph\xf2ng nhi\u1ec1u \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i v\u1eabn \u0111ang ch\u1edd. K\u1ebft n\u1ed1i l\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c l\xe0m ch\u1ee7 ph\xf2ng."],t.s)
B.aoj=s(["Descartar","Ignorer","Schlie\xdfen","Fechar","\u9589\u3058\u308b","\u092c\u0902\u0926 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902","Abaikan","B\u1ecf qua"],t.s)
B.apd=s(["es un juego de dados para tel\xe9fonos y la web desarrollado con Flutter y Dart. Admite jugadores humanos y robots, puntuaci\xf3n de las secciones superior e inferior, bono de la secci\xf3n superior, bono de cinco iguales, historial guardado, consejos y la presentaci\xf3n compartida de T-G-Apps.","est un jeu de d\xe9s pour t\xe9l\xe9phone et le Web d\xe9velopp\xe9 avec Flutter et Dart. Il prend en charge les joueurs humains et robots, les sections sup\xe9rieure et inf\xe9rieure, le bonus sup\xe9rieur, le bonus de cinq identiques, l\u2019historique enregistr\xe9, les conseils et la pr\xe9sentation commune de T-G-Apps.","ist ein mit Flutter und Dart entwickeltes W\xfcrfelspiel f\xfcr Smartphones und das Web. Es unterst\xfctzt Menschen und Roboter, obere und untere Wertung, oberen Bonus, F\xfcnfling-Bonus, gespeicherten Verlauf, Hinweise und die gemeinsame T-G-Apps-Darstellung.","\xe9 um jogo de dados para celular e web desenvolvido com Flutter e Dart. Oferece jogadores humanos e rob\xf4s, pontua\xe7\xe3o superior e inferior, b\xf4nus superior, b\xf4nus de cinco iguais, hist\xf3rico salvo, dicas e a apresenta\xe7\xe3o compartilhada da T-G-Apps.","\u306fFlutter\u3068Dart\u3067\u958b\u767a\u3055\u308c\u305f\u30b9\u30de\u30fc\u30c8\u30d5\u30a9\u30f3\u304a\u3088\u3073Web\u5411\u3051\u30c0\u30a4\u30b9\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3067\u3059\u3002\u4eba\u9593\u3068\u30ed\u30dc\u30c3\u30c8\u306e\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc\u3001\u4e0a\u4e0b\u6bb5\u306e\u5f97\u70b9\u3001\u4e0a\u6bb5\u30dc\u30fc\u30ca\u30b9\u3001\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30d6\u30fb\u30aa\u30d6\u30fb\u30a2\u30fb\u30ab\u30a4\u30f3\u30c9\u30fb\u30dc\u30fc\u30ca\u30b9\u3001\u5c65\u6b74\u4fdd\u5b58\u3001\u30d2\u30f3\u30c8\u3001T-G-Apps\u5171\u901a\u30c7\u30b6\u30a4\u30f3\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002","Flutter \u0914\u0930 Dart \u0938\u0947 \u0935\u093f\u0915\u0938\u093f\u0924 \u090f\u0915 \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u0914\u0930 \u0935\u0947\u092c \u092a\u093e\u0938\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u093e \u0917\u0947\u092e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u092f\u0939 \u0907\u0902\u0938\u093e\u0928 \u0914\u0930 \u0930\u094b\u092c\u094b\u091f \u0916\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0921\u093c\u093f\u092f\u094b\u0902, \u090a\u092a\u0930\u0940 \u0914\u0930 \u0928\u093f\u091a\u0932\u0947 \u0916\u0902\u0921 \u0938\u094d\u0915\u094b\u0930\u093f\u0902\u0917, \u090a\u092a\u0930\u0940-\u0916\u0902\u0921 \u092c\u094b\u0928\u0938, \u092a\u093e\u0901\u091a \u090f\u0915 \u091c\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u093e\u0938\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u093e \u092c\u094b\u0928\u0938, \u0938\u0939\u0947\u091c\u093e \u0917\u092f\u093e \u0916\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0921\u093c\u0940 \u0907\u0924\u093f\u0939\u093e\u0938, \u0938\u0902\u0915\u0947\u0924, \u0914\u0930 \u0938\u093e\u091d\u093e T-G-Apps \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0938\u094d\u0924\u0941\u0924\u093f \u0915\u093e \u0938\u092e\u0930\u094d\u0925\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964","adalah permainan dadu ponsel dan web yang dikembangkan dengan Flutter dan Dart. Mendukung pemain manusia dan robot, penilaian bagian atas dan bawah, bonus bagian atas, bonus Lima Sejenis, riwayat pemain tersimpan, petunjuk, dan tampilan T-G-Apps bersama.","l\xe0 tr\xf2 ch\u01a1i x\xfac x\u1eafc tr\xean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i v\xe0 web \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\xe1t tri\u1ec3n b\u1eb1ng Flutter v\xe0 Dart. H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u01a1i l\xe0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi v\xe0 robot, t\xednh \u0111i\u1ec3m ph\u1ea7n tr\xean v\xe0 ph\u1ea7n d\u01b0\u1edbi, th\u01b0\u1edfng ph\u1ea7n tr\xean, th\u01b0\u1edfng n\u0103m x\xfac x\u1eafc gi\u1ed1ng nhau, l\u1ecbch s\u1eed ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u01a1i \u0111\xe3 l\u01b0u, g\u1ee3i \xfd, v\xe0 giao di\u1ec7n T-G-Apps chung."],t.s)
B.a6s=s(["El Jugador 1 siempre es Humano en modo Pasar y jugar.","Le Joueur 1 est toujours Humain en mode Passe-et-joue.","Spieler 1 ist im Weitergabe-Spiel immer ein Mensch.","O Jogador 1 \xe9 sempre Humano no modo Passa-e-joga.","\u30d1\u30b9\uff06\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3067\u306f\u3001\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc1\u306f\u5e38\u306b\u4eba\u9593\u3067\u3059\u3002","\u092a\u093e\u0938-\u090f\u0902\u0921-\u092a\u094d\u0932\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0916\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0921\u093c\u0940 1 \u0939\u092e\u0947\u0936\u093e \u0907\u0902\u0938\u093e\u0928 \u0939\u094b\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964","Pemain 1 selalu Manusia dalam mode Oper dan Main.","Ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u01a1i 1 lu\xf4n l\xe0 Ng\u01b0\u1eddi trong ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 Chuy\u1ec1n tay v\xe0 ch\u01a1i."],t.s)
B.afx=s(["Abandonar el turno","Abandonner le tour","Runde aufgeben","Abandonar a vez","\u3053\u306e\u30bf\u30fc\u30f3\u3092\u653e\u68c4\u3059\u308b","\u092c\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u091b\u094b\u0921\u093c \u0926\u0947\u0902","Batalkan giliran","B\u1ecf l\u01b0\u1ee3t ch\u01a1i"],t.s)
B.apk=s(["La partida multitel\xe9fono se ejecuta en el tel\xe9fono del anfitri\xf3n, as\xed que no puede continuar sin \xe9l. Si el anfitri\xf3n se reconecta pronto, la partida se reanudar\xe1 por s\xed sola.","La partie multi-t\xe9l\xe9phone s\u2019ex\xe9cute sur le t\xe9l\xe9phone de l\u2019h\xf4te, elle ne peut donc pas continuer sans lui. Si l\u2019h\xf4te se reconnecte rapidement, la partie reprendra automatiquement.","Das Mehrger\xe4te-Spiel l\xe4uft auf dem Telefon des Hosts und kann ohne dieses nicht fortgesetzt werden. Verbindet sich der Host bald wieder, l\xe4uft das Spiel von selbst weiter.","O jogo em v\xe1rios celulares roda no celular do anfitri\xe3o, ent\xe3o n\xe3o pode continuar sem ele. Se o anfitri\xe3o se reconectar em breve, o jogo ser\xe1 retomado automaticamente.","\u8907\u6570\u7aef\u672b\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u306f\u30db\u30b9\u30c8\u306e\u7aef\u672b\u4e0a\u3067\u52d5\u4f5c\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u305f\u3081\u3001\u30db\u30b9\u30c8\u304c\u3044\u306a\u3044\u3068\u7d9a\u884c\u3067\u304d\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u30db\u30b9\u30c8\u304c\u307e\u3082\u306a\u304f\u518d\u63a5\u7d9a\u3059\u308c\u3070\u3001\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u306f\u81ea\u52d5\u7684\u306b\u518d\u958b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002","\u092e\u0932\u094d\u091f\u0940-\u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u0917\u0947\u092e \u0939\u094b\u0938\u094d\u091f \u0915\u0947 \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u092a\u0930 \u091a\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948, \u0907\u0938\u0932\u093f\u090f \u0909\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e \u092f\u0939 \u091c\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0930\u0939 \u0938\u0915\u0924\u093e\u0964 \u0905\u0917\u0930 \u0939\u094b\u0938\u094d\u091f \u091c\u0932\u094d\u0926 \u0939\u0940 \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0928\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948, \u0924\u094b \u092f\u0939 \u0917\u0947\u092e \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0906\u092a \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0936\u0941\u0930\u0942 \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u090f\u0917\u093e\u0964","Permainan multi-ponsel berjalan di ponsel host, jadi tidak dapat dilanjutkan tanpanya. Jika host tersambung kembali segera, permainan ini akan otomatis dilanjutkan.","Tr\xf2 ch\u01a1i nhi\u1ec1u \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i ch\u1ea1y tr\xean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a ch\u1ee7 ph\xf2ng, n\xean kh\xf4ng th\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c n\u1ebfu thi\u1ebfu \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i \u0111\xf3. N\u1ebfu ch\u1ee7 ph\xf2ng k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i l\u1ea1i s\u1edbm, tr\xf2 ch\u01a1i s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c."],t.s)
